SQL> ---1. WAQTD NUMBER OF EMPLOYEES GETTING SALARY LESS THAN 2000 IN DEPTNO 10.
  1  SELECT COUNT(*)
  2  FROM EMP
  3* WHERE SAL<2000 AND DEPTNO IN 10
SQL> /

  COUNT(*)                                                                                          
----------                                                                                          
         1     
                                                                                     

SQL> ---2.2. WAQTD TOTAL SALARY NEEDED TO PAY EMPLOYEES WORKING AS CLERK.

